(property "Description" " | design | W2 GR-3 (R-E1-09): PTC on PWR-A in the LAB5 feed of the RF relay coils K401/K402 (2 x G6K DC5, about 21.1 mA, build/08 step 10). Bourns MF-MSMF075/24-2: Ihold 0.75 A / Itrip 1.50 A at 23 C; Ihold 0.60 A at 50 C and 0.49 A at 70 C (Bourns MF-MSMF REV. AO, p.1 and p.4, as F301). It limits the S04 lead to the RF board (LAB5_RLY, one JST PH contact rated 2 A) instead of F102 4 A, so no Micro-Fit is needed on the 5.5 mm RF board.; Reflow only: the maker forbids wave and hand soldering." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
